  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resonance - From Divided Cities to Shared Stages - ODA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project combines post-conflict expertise with high-quality music education and youth engagement. It will provide a concrete, practice-based case study of how civil society organisations engage young people in reconciliation outside formal political or institutional frameworks, thereby grounding policy dialogue in lived experience.</narrative>
  </description>
